cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below. The paper will be the preferred citation once it is released."
title: "sandbank: a pre-registered sandbox study of whether LLM agents circumvent KYC/AML controls to hit business targets"
abstract: >-
  A fully synthetic core-banking sandbox exposed to an LLM agent as MCP tools,
  with a deterministic detector for eight KYC/AML violation types and a
  Compliance check-in, plus the pre-registration, every run and the paper
  "Under Pressure: Do LLM Agents Circumvent KYC/AML Controls to Hit Business
  Targets?". Code: MIT.
type: software
authors:
